{"3783630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WorldWasGray", "steam_appid": 3783630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Was Gray</strong> is a cozy, relaxing game about bringing color back to a quiet world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything begins desaturated and still. Benches, trains, houses, princess castles, fairy lands, amusement park, fields — all waiting. Using gentle, magical tools, you paint, restore, and slowly return warmth and life to each place. There’s no rush, no pressure, and no wrong way to play. You move at your own pace, enjoying the simple satisfaction of watching the world change under your touch.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the story of why the world turned gray at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore a grayscale world through gentle, tactile painting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, cozy levels with clear visual progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm, low-pressure experience with no combat or failure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft music and sound design made for relaxation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, storybook-inspired art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little surprises hidden for curious players</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Was Gray</strong> is a cozy, relaxing game about bringing color back to a quiet world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything begins desaturated and still. Benches, trains, houses, princess castles, fairy lands, amusement park, fields — all waiting. Using gentle, magical tools, you paint, restore, and slowly return warmth and life to each place. There’s no rush, no pressure, and no wrong way to play. You move at your own pace, enjoying the simple satisfaction of watching the world change under your touch.  </p><p class=\